css start
------------------
stands for cascading stylesheet
developed by Hakon wium lie and Bert Boss in 1996
describes how html element(tags) are to be display on web browser.
single line comment are not valid in css
i- internal css
------------------------------
 syntax of internal css --- 
 <style>
        selector{
            property:value;
            property:value;
            property:value;
        }
         selector{
            property:value;property:value;property:value;
        }
 </style>
ii- external css
iii - inline css










Selector
---------------
it is used to select html tags to apply css.

Types of selector
----------------------
i- Tag/element Selector
ii- Class Selector
iii- ID Selector
iv- Group Selector
v- Child Selector
vi- Pseudo Selector
vii- Odd Selector
vii- Even Selector
viii- Direct Child Selector
ix- nth-Child Selector
x- Universal Selector











